#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partner_billing_policy.view_partner_form
msgid "Billing Policy"
msgstr "請求方針"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:partner_billing_policy.field_res_partner__billing_scope
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partner_billing_policy.res_partner_view_search
msgid "Billing Scope"
msgstr "請求範囲"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:partner_billing_policy.selection__res_partner__billing_scope__full
msgid "Full Billing"
msgstr "全請求"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:partner_billing_policy.selection__res_partner__billing_scope__partial
msgid "Partial Billing"
msgstr "部分請求"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:partner_billing_policy.field_res_partner__prorated_billing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partner_billing_policy.res_partner_view_search
msgid "Prorated Billing"
msgstr "日割り請求"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_billing_policy.field_res_partner__billing_scope
msgid ""
"Vendor contract condition for rented equipment: under full billing the "
"vendor is paid for every month the device is installed, regardless of the "
"patient's visits; under partial billing only months with a billable visit "
"are paid."
msgstr "レンタル機器の仕入先契約条件。全請求では患者の受診に関わらず設置中の月はすべて支払対象となり、部分請求では請求対象の受診があった月のみ支払対象となる。"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_billing_policy.field_res_partner__prorated_billing
msgid ""
"Whether a rental is charged pro rata for a partial month. The two settings "
"below choose which partial months."
msgstr "月の途中の設置・回収時に日割りで請求するか。どちらの月に適用するかは下の2項目で選ぶ。"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:partner_billing_policy.field_res_partner__prorate_collection_month
msgid "Prorate Collection Month"
msgstr "回収月に適用"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:partner_billing_policy.field_res_partner__prorate_installation_month
msgid "Prorate Installation Month"
msgstr "開始月に適用"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_billing_policy.field_res_partner__prorate_collection_month
msgid ""
"Charge the collection month from the first of the month to the day before "
"collection, rather than in full."
msgstr "回収月を満額ではなく、月初から回収日の前日までの日割りで請求する。"

#. module: partner_billing_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_billing_policy.field_res_partner__prorate_installation_month
msgid ""
"Charge the installation month from the installation day to the month end, "
"rather than in full."
msgstr "開始月（設置月）を満額ではなく、設置日から月末までの日割りで請求する。"
